燃やし尽くす マグマ ドラマ
burning them all down in a magma drama.

188
00:18:45,571 --> 00:18:46,871
この悪なき渇き
This thirst without evil,

189
00:18:46,871 --> 00:18:48,071
青い炎みたい
like a blue flame.

190
