195
00:19:07,071 --> 00:19:13,071
情熱の火はいつしか いつに日にか
The days of passion will eventually, come to an end

196
00:19:13,071 --> 00:19:18,071
体は気付いている 僕らはいつか消える
Our bodies are aware we will someday disappear

197
00:19:18,071 --> 00:19:24,071
ゆるやかに若さを溶かして 泣かないで why so serious?
Gently melting our youth, don't cry, why so serious?

198
00:19:24,571 --> 00:19:29,571
あぁ まだ間に合う
Ah, there's still time

199
00:19:30,071 --> 00:19:35,071
あぁ ただ burn it up baby
Ah, just burn it up, baby

200
00:19:35,271 --> 00:19:40,071
sorry darling そんなに甘くないよ でもきっとそんなに悪くないよ
Sorry darling, it's not that sweet, but surely, it's not that bad

201
00:19:41,071 --> 00:19:47,571
あぁ give me fire, light it up baby 燃やしちゃうぜ yeah
Ah, give me fire, light it up, baby, let it burn, yeah

202
