give me fire light it up baby 燃やしちゃうぜ yeah
Give me fire, light it up baby! We'll burn it up, yeah!

207
00:20:21,546 --> 00:20:25,546
party is over
The party is over...

208
00:20:26,046 --> 00:20:31,046
それでも 踊りたかった
...even so, I wanted to dance.

209
00:20:40,046 --> 00:20:42,546
Wow! Woo!
Woo! Yeah!

210
00:20:42,546 --> 00:20:44,546
奏ちゃんお誕生日おめでとう！ Happy Birthday!
Kanade-chan, happy birthday! Happy Birthday!

211
00:20:44,546 --> 00:20:48,546
Thank you very much! 誕生日ガール！ Yeah!
Thank you very much! Birthday girl! Yeah!

212
00:20:49,046 --> 00:20:54,046
まず、最初のゲストはカリオペ先輩に来ていただきました！
First of all, our first guest is Calliope-senpai!

213
00:20:54,246 --> 00:21:02,046
はじめまして！ Hi everybody! Yo, yo, what's up? It's Mori Calliope here today to celebrate Kanade's special birthday. よっ太！
Nice to meet you! Hi everybody! Yo, yo, what's up? It's Mori Calliope here today to celebrate Kanade's special birthday, yo!

214
00:21:02,146 --> 00:21:06,046
