あなたの見てる正体
...your true identity that you see.

268
00:23:54,046 --> 00:23:59,046
誰も読めないカルテ
A medical chart that no one can read...

269
00:23:59,046 --> 00:24:03,546
不可思議 知りたいだけ
...I just want to know the mystery.

270
00:24:05,046 --> 00:24:10,046
嘘も現実も
Both lies and reality...

271
00:24:10,046 --> 00:24:15,546
どっちも真実だったの 本当よ
...were both the truth, really.

272
00:24:20,046 --> 00:24:24,546
今日もひとりごと
Talking to myself again today...

273
00:24:24,546 --> 00:24:30,046
なんにも無理をしないで
...without pushing myself too hard...

274
00:24:30,046 --> 00:24:36,546
わたし愛されたい
...I want to be loved.

275
00:24:47,046 --> 00:24:52,046
有耶無耶 サヨナラ 軽い眩暈
A hazy goodbye, a light dizziness...

276
00:24:52,046 --> 00:24:56,546
あなたのいない現象界
...in a world of phenomena without you.

277
00:24:56,546 --> 00:25:01,046
誰も読めないカルテ
A medical chart that no one can read.

278
