なんにも 疑わないで
...hoping to doubt nothing...

286
00:25:52,694 --> 00:25:58,294
混ざり 溶け合いたい
...and to just blend and melt together.

287
00:25:59,894 --> 00:26:04,594
たわいない 判らない 理由 存在
A silly, incomprehensible reason for existence...

288
00:26:04,594 --> 00:26:09,394
あなたと 残す 後悔
...and the regrets I leave behind with you.

289
00:26:09,594 --> 00:26:13,094
誰も読めない カルテ
A medical chart that no one can read...

290
00:26:13,094 --> 00:26:18,094
不愉快 繰り返して
...disagreeable and constantly repeating.

291
00:26:30,094 --> 00:26:34,894
正しい夢は
Is a correct dream...

292
00:26:34,894 --> 00:26:39,894
哀しい声は
...or a sad voice...

293
00:26:39,894 --> 00:26:45,094
美しい 疑わしい 羨ましい
...beautiful, doubtful, or enviable?

294
00:26:48,094 --> 00:26:51,594
ねえ、どれ
Hey, which one is it?

295
00:26:52,094 --> 00:26:56,894
語れない 眠れない トロイメライ
An unspeakable, sleepless reverie...

296
00:26:56,894 --> 00:27:01,394
あなたの見てる正体
...the true form that you are seeing.

297
00:27:01,594 --> 00:27:05,194
誰も読めないカルテ
A medical chart that no one can read...

298
00:27:05,194 --> 00:27:11,594
不可思議 知りたいだけ
...I just want to know the mystery.

299
00:27:12,094 --> 00:27:16,594
終わらない ことはない トロイメライ
An endless reverie...

300
00:27:16,594 --> 00:27:21,394
あなたと跨ぐ境界
...crossing the boundary with you.

301
00:27:21,594 --> 00:27:25,094
誰も読めないカルテ
A medical chart that no one can read...

302
00:27:25,094 --> 00:27:31,794
思春期 傷口 胸の内
Adolescence, raw wounds, my inner feelings...

303
00:27:31,794 --> 00:27:37,594
不可思議 知りたいだけ
...I just want to know the mystery.

304
00:27:44,094 --> 00:27:46,594
はい、ということで！
Alright, so...

305
00:27:46,594 --> 00:27:50,094
にじさんじから、町田ちまさんに来ていただきましたー！
...we have Machita Chima-san from Nijisanji here with us!

306
00:27:50,494 --> 00:27:55,894
おまえらの皆さんこんばんは！上から読んでも下から読んでも町田ちまでーす！
Good evening, everyone! Whether read from the top or the bottom, I'm Machita Chima!

307
00:27:55,894 --> 00:27:57,094
わーい！
Yay!

308
00:27:57,094 --> 00:27:59,294
ちまさんにも「おまえら」が浸透してる！
Even Chima-san is using "Omaera"!

309
00:27:59,294 --> 00:28:01,094
もちろん知っています！
Of course I know it!

310
00:28:01,094 --> 00:28:02,094
知ってるんですか！？
You know it!?

311
00:28:02,094 --> 00:28:04,294
お誕生日おめでとうございます！奏ちゃん！
Happy birthday, Kanade-chan!

312
00:28:04,294 --> 00:28:05,594
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

313
00:28:05,594 --> 00:28:08,094
何なんですかその動き、やばい
What are those movements? That's crazy.

314
00:28:08,294 --> 00:28:10,094
いや、ついやってちゃうんですこれ
Well, I just end up doing them automatically.

315
00:28:10,094 --> 00:28:11,294
あ、やってちゃう、癖なんですか？
Oh, you just do them. Is it a habit?

316
00:28:11,294 --> 00:28:12,394
癖なんです
It's a habit.

317
00:28:12,394 --> 00:28:15,594
それちょっとリハーサルの時も...
You were doing that during rehearsals, too...

318
00:28:15,594 --> 00:28:17,394
やめて、ばらすのやめてください！
Stop! Please don't expose me!

319
00:28:17,394 --> 00:28:19,594
変な動きが出る癖なんですね
So you have a habit of making weird movements.

320
00:28:19,594 --> 00:28:22,094
うん、でも今日はちょっと大人しくね、お話します
Yes, but today I'll speak calmly.

321
00:28:22,094 --> 00:28:26,594
なるほど、ちょっと出てましたけど、全然出していただいて大丈夫ですからね
I see. Some came out, but it's totally fine to let it all out, okay?

322
00:28:26,594 --> 00:28:27,794
気のせい、気のせいです
It's your imagination, just your imagination.

323
00:28:27,794 --> 00:28:33,294
そういえばちまさんとはですね、先日、一緒に「空想列車」という楽曲の「歌ってみた」をコラボさせていただきまして
By the way, Chima-san and I recently collaborated on a cover of the song "Kuusou Ressha"...

324
00:28:33,294 --> 00:28:36,094
コラボさせていただきまして
...which we released together.

325
00:28:36,094 --> 00:28:38,294
本当にありがとうございました！
Thank you so much!

326
00:28:38,294 --> 00:28:41,294
こちらこそ！お誘いいただいて本当に嬉しかったです
Likewise! I was really happy to be invited.

327
00:28:41,294 --> 00:28:43,094
そうですか！やったー！
Really? Yay!

328
00:28:43,094 --> 00:28:48,894
からでも、もう、ちまさんの透明な歌声に絶対に似合うだろうなと思って「空想列車」もそうだし
From my side, I thought it would suit Chima-san's crystal-clear voice perfectly, which was true for "Kuusou Ressha"...

329
00:28:48,894 --> 00:28:54,094
今回の「不可思議のカルテ」も絶対に似合うだろうなと思って選曲させていただきまして
...and I also chose "Fukashigi no Karte" this time believing it would suit you perfectly as well.

330
00:28:54,094 --> 00:28:55,294
嬉しい！
I'm so happy!

331
00:28:55,294 --> 00:28:57,394
一緒に歌えてとっても嬉しいです！
I'm so glad we could sing together!

332
00:28:57,394 --> 00:28:59,094
本当に幸せです
I'm truly happy.

333
00:28:59,594 --> 00:29:02,094
でも、からで、なんか1個気になってることがあって
But there's one thing I was curious about...

334
00:29:02,094 --> 00:29:03,094
何でしょう？
What is it?

335
00:29:03,094 --> 00:29:08,594
「空想列車」のコメント欄に、なんか「化け物」って書いてあったんですけど...ちまさんのこと
In the comments section of "Kuusou Ressha," someone called Chima-san a "monster"...

336
00:29:09,594 --> 00:29:11,094
それは何なんですか？
What is that about?

337
00:29:11,094 --> 00:29:16,594
多分別人...あの、違う人のことを言ってるのかなって思うので、忘れてください
Probably a different person... I think they were referring to someone else, so please forget about it.

338
00:29:17,094 --> 00:29:20,594
わかりました！そんな、こんな、こんな綺麗な、お姉さん、綺麗な
Got it! There's no way such a beautiful lady...

339
00:29:20,594 --> 00:29:22,594
そうよ、こんなねえ
Exactly, someone like me...

340
00:29:22,594 --> 00:29:28,094
化け物なわけがないですよね。今コメントでも「化け物」って書いてあったけど...ちょっと見間違えてますよね、これね？
...could be a monster. Even in the live comments now, people are writing "monster," but they must be mistaken, right?

341
00:29:28,094 --> 00:29:31,094
見間違いだよね。我々2人とも清楚だもんね
Must be a mistake. We are both pure and proper, after all.

342
00:29:31,094 --> 00:29:34,594
もちろん、からでも清楚です、そりゃあもう！
Of course, I am pure too, absolutely!

343
00:29:35,094 --> 00:29:38,094
はい、ということで、ちまさん、一緒に歌えてとっても嬉しかったです！
Yes! So, Chima-san, I was really happy to sing with you!

344
00:29:38,094 --> 00:29:40,094
こちらこそ、嬉しかった！
Me too, I was happy!

345
00:29:40,594 --> 00:29:44,294
嬉しかったですね。よかったら、また機会があったら、また一緒に歌わせてください！
I'm so glad. If there's another chance, please let us sing together again!

346
00:29:44,294 --> 00:29:45,894
いつでも歌いましょう！
Let's sing anytime!

347
00:29:45,894 --> 00:29:48,094
やったー！言質取りましたー！
Yay! I got your promise!

348
00:29:48,094 --> 00:29:49,094
やった、やったー
Yay, yay!

349
00:29:49,094 --> 00:29:50,094
嬉しい！
I'm so happy!

350
00:29:50,094 --> 00:29:52,594
じゃあ、このあとも、引き続き、頑張ってください
Well, please keep doing your best for the rest of the show.

351
00:29:52,594 --> 00:29:53,294
ありがとうございます
Thank you so much!

352
00:29:53,294 --> 00:29:54,094
応援してます
I'm rooting for you.

353
00:29:54,094 --> 00:29:56,094
ちまさん、ありがとうございました！
Chima-san, thank you very much!

354
00:29:56,094 --> 00:29:57,094
まったねー！
See ya!

355
00:29:57,094 --> 00:29:59,094
まったねー！
See ya!

356
00:30:00,369 --> 00:30:01,869
ふう
Phew...

357
00:30:02,069 --> 00:30:05,569
ということで ちょっと奏もお水を飲んできてもいいですか？
So, is it okay if Kanade gets a quick drink of water?

358
00:30:05,669 --> 00:30:08,569
ちょっとだけお水飲んできます
I'll be right back after a quick drink.

359
00:30:15,069 --> 00:30:16,569
あー
Ah...

360
00:30:16,869 --> 00:30:20,069
まだまだまだ 続いていきますよ！
There's still much, much more to come!

361
00:30:20,569 --> 00:30:24,569
次は誰かしら？ あと二人ですね
Who will it be next? There are two left.

362
00:30:25,069 --> 00:30:28,569
二分の一の確率。それではお楽しみにしてください！
A 50% chance. Please look forward to it!

363
00:30:28,569 --> 00:30:30,569
次の曲、いくぞ！
Here we go with the next song!

364
00:30:51,569 --> 00:30:53,869
あれが世界なんて
Is that what they call the world?

365
00:30:53,869 --> 00:30:56,269
誰の成れの果て
Whose ruins are those?

366
00:30:56,269 --> 00:30:58,269
なんだっての悶々
What's with all this agony?

367
00:30:58,269 --> 00:31:00,869
答えも欲しいのも一個てこれだけ
I only want one single answer, and this is it.

368
00:31:01,269 --> 00:31:04,569
悩んだってしょうがないじゃんね
There's no point in worrying anyway, is there?

369
00:31:05,269 --> 00:31:08,569
あれは夢だったって思うことにしたって
Even if I decided to think of it as a dream...

370
00:31:08,869 --> 00:31:09,869
つら
It hurts...

371
00:31:09,869 --> 00:31:13,269
でも全然思えないんだけど助けてよフォロワー！
But I can't think that way at all, so help me, followers!

372
00:31:13,269 --> 00:31:15,569
抗うだけ若さに負け
Just struggling, losing to youth,

373
00:31:15,569 --> 00:31:18,569
next, next, lucky, lucky, lucky

374
00:31:20,069 --> 00:31:21,869
アーリーオー 割り切れ
Early-oh, get over it,

375
00:31:21,869 --> 00:31:22,869
たらさ
then.

376
00:31:23,269 --> 00:31:26,569
オーリーオー 楽なNoneとこ
Only-oh, some easy place with none.

377
00:31:28,069 --> 00:31:30,869
あぁもうヤダ！
Ah, I've had enough!

378
00:31:33,069 --> 00:31:35,069
なんていう新世界か！
What kind of new world is this!

379
00:31:35,069 --> 00:31:36,569
あなた以外は
Other than you...

380
00:31:36,569 --> 00:31:38,069
あなた以外はいらないないない
Other than you, I don't need anyone, anyone, anyone.

381
00:31:40,069 --> 00:31:41,869
はらないでよバリア
Don't put up a barrier.

382
00:31:41,869 --> 00:31:43,269
あるはずの何か
Something that's supposed to be there,

383
00:31:43,269 --> 00:31:46,569
あったならばhappy, jumpin', yeah
if it's there, then happy, jumpin', yeah!

384
00:31:47,569 --> 00:31:50,869
あなたのその手とあたしのは手を
Your hand and my hand,

385
00:31:50,869 --> 00:31:54,069
つないだらもう二度と離さないわ
once we hold them, I'll never let go again.

386
00:31:54,269 --> 00:31:57,269
あなたのその手があたしのは手を
That hand of yours and my hand,

387
00:31:57,269 --> 00:32:01,869
掴んだら...以後お見知りおきを！my love
once you grab it... please get to know me! My love!

388
00:32:03,569 --> 00:32:06,569
これで終わりなんて
Is this how it ends?

389
00:32:07,069 --> 00:32:09,069
アガれないままなんて
With things still not hyping up?

390
00:32:09,069 --> 00:32:10,569
鳴いちゃってポンポンポン
Crying out, bang, bang, bang.

391
00:32:10,869 --> 00:32:13,869
どうにかなっちゃえって願って願って
Just wishing and wishing for things to go crazy.

392
00:32:13,869 --> 00:32:16,869
ねぇ朝帰りしたりしちゃう？どう？
Hey, should we stay out all night? What do you say?

393
00:32:17,069 --> 00:32:18,569
なぁもう我慢できん！
Man, I can't hold back anymore!

394
00:32:18,569 --> 00:32:20,569
pain, pain 痛いってば everyday
Pain, pain, it hurts, everyday.

395
00:32:20,569 --> 00:32:23,569
まゆーていけるけどなブルベ夏なんで関係ないな
I can manage, but I'm a Cool Summer so it doesn't matter anyway.

396
00:32:23,569 --> 00:32:25,569
誰よりもネコ節操ないも結構
More than anyone, a cat, having no integrity is fine too.

397
00:32:25,569 --> 00:32:30,069
あーしはあーしだ見ていてよready
I am who I am, keep your eyes on me, ready.

398
00:32:31,569 --> 00:32:34,569
もう今日で終わらせたいなって保存
I feel like ending it all today,

399
00:32:34,569 --> 00:32:37,869
リスタートできたらって
I wish I could restart.

400
00:32:37,869 --> 00:32:40,869
でも無理よもう
But it's impossible now.

401
00:32:42,569 --> 00:32:44,869
what's on your mind?

402
00:32:45,069 --> 00:32:47,569
アーリーオー 割り切れ たらさ
Early-oh, get over it, then.

403
00:32:47,569 --> 00:32:51,069
オーリーオー 楽なNoneとこ
Only-oh, some easy place with none.

404
00:32:52,069 --> 00:32:54,869
あぁもうヤダ！
Ah, I've had enough!

405
00:32:58,869 --> 00:33:00,869
なんていう新世界か！
What kind of new world is this!

406
00:33:00,869 --> 00:33:02,569
あなた以外は
Other than you...

407
00:33:02,569 --> 00:33:05,569
あなた以外はいらないないない
Other than you, I don't need anyone, anyone, anyone.

408
00:33:05,569 --> 00:33:07,569
はらないでよバリア
Don't put up a barrier.

409
00:33:07,569 --> 00:33:09,069
あるはずの何か
Something that's supposed to be there,

410
00:33:09,069 --> 00:33:12,569
あったならばhappy, jumpin', yeah
if it's there, then happy, jumpin', yeah!

411
00:33:13,069 --> 00:33:16,269
あなたのその手とあたしのは手を
Your hand and my hand,

412
00:33:16,269 --> 00:33:19,569
つないだらもう二度と離さないわ
once we hold them, I'll never let go again.

413
00:33:19,869 --> 00:33:22,869
あなたのその手があたしのは手を
That hand of yours and my hand,

414
00:33:22,869 --> 00:33:27,569
掴んだら...以後お見知りおきを！my love
once you grab it... please get to know me! My love!

415
00:33:39,069 --> 00:33:41,869
お見知りおきを！my love
Please get to know me! My love!

416
00:33:48,569 --> 00:33:54,569
はい！なんと、三人目のゲストは、同じく、にじさんじから、戌亥とこさんに来ていただきました！
Yes! What do you know, our third guest is also from Nijisanji, Inui Toko-san has joined us!

417
00:33:55,069 --> 00:33:59,869
まいどー、にじさんじ所属、公式つよつよケルベロス、戌亥とこです
Maido! Nijisanji's official strong Cerberus, Inui Toko here!

418
00:33:59,869 --> 00:34:01,569
戌亥とこです
Inui Toko here.

419
00:34:01,869 --> 00:34:03,069
いぬいとこ？
Inui Toko?

420
00:34:03,069 --> 00:34:04,269
戌亥とこ。
Inui Toko.

421
00:34:04,269 --> 00:34:05,569
戌亥、と...
Inui, To...

422
00:34:05,569 --> 00:34:07,069
いぬい、とこ。
Inui, Toko.

423
00:34:07,069 --> 00:34:09,069
いぬい...
Inui...

424
00:34:09,069 --> 00:34:10,569
難しいよ！
It's so hard!

425
00:34:10,569 --> 00:34:12,269
いいよ、好きに呼んでいいですよ。
It's fine, you can call me whatever you like.

426
00:34:12,269 --> 00:34:15,569
とこさん、お誕生日おめでとうございます！
Toko-san, Happy Birthday to you!

427
00:34:15,569 --> 00:34:17,569
ありがとうー！
Thank you!

428
00:34:17,569 --> 00:34:19,569
Happy Birthday! Yeah! Nice to meet you!

429
00:34:19,569 --> 00:34:22,569
Nice to meet you too! はじめ... 初めましてじゃない？
Nice to meet you too! Nice to... Wait, isn't this our first time meeting?

430
00:34:22,569 --> 00:34:24,069
初めましてですよ。
It is our first time.

431
00:34:24,069 --> 00:34:27,569
今日、初めまして。結構ガチの初めまして。
Today is our first time. A real, genuine first meeting.

432
00:34:27,569 --> 00:34:30,569
いるの？今日ガチの初めまして... 私たち...
Is there really a genuine first-time meeting today... for us?

433
00:34:30,569 --> 00:34:31,569
いない、いない、いない。
No, no, no.

434
00:34:31,569 --> 00:34:38,069
ちょっと、ね、千真さんとはカオスレゾナンスの「歌ってみた」でご一緒させていただいたんですけど
Well, we did do a cover of 'Chaos Resonance' together,

435
00:34:38,069 --> 00:34:40,569
本当の本当の今日、初めて。
but today is the absolute very first time we've met.

436
00:34:40,569 --> 00:34:41,569
本当の初めまして。
The real first meeting.

437
00:34:41,569 --> 00:34:47,869
もう今日、初めましての時、あの、とこさんが楽屋に来ていただいて、で、ご挨拶に来ていただいて。ありがとうございます。
Today, when we met for the first time, Toko-san came to my dressing room to say hello. Thank you so much.

438
00:34:47,869 --> 00:34:49,069
いえいえ、こちらこそ。
No problem, thank you too.

439
00:34:49,069 --> 00:34:54,569
で、なんか、その時にお弁当が奏の部屋にあったから、「あ、よかったらお弁当食べますか？」って言って、あの、「選んでください」って。
And then, since there were bento boxes in my dressing room at the time, I asked, "Oh, would you like to have one?" and told her to choose.

440
00:34:54,569 --> 00:34:59,069
カレーだったんですけど、カレーとなんか付随するものがあるお弁当だったんですけど...
It was curry, curry and some side dishes...

441
00:35:00,117 --> 00:35:01,417
んですけど、なんか、トコさんが...
...but Toko-san...

442
00:35:01,417 --> 00:35:04,317
一言放ったんですよ。
...said one thing.

443
00:35:04,317 --> 00:35:06,517
「芋だ！」
"Potatoes!"

444
00:35:06,517 --> 00:35:08,617
お芋が大好きなんです、私。
I love sweet potatoes.

445
00:35:08,617 --> 00:35:09,617
芋？
Potatoes?

446
00:35:09,617 --> 00:35:11,317
お芋めっちゃ好きなんですよ。
I really love sweet potatoes.

447
00:35:11,317 --> 00:35:13,317
カレーなのに、芋？
Even though it's curry, potatoes?

448
00:35:13,317 --> 00:35:14,917
いや、お芋が好きだから。
No, because I just love sweet potatoes.

449
00:35:15,617 --> 00:35:17,517
「芋好きなんだ」って思って、
I thought, "Oh, she likes potatoes,"

450
00:35:17,517 --> 00:35:19,517
芋があるお弁当だったから、
and since there was a bento with potatoes,

451
00:35:19,517 --> 00:35:21,117
「あ、よかった」って思って、
I was like, "Oh, thank goodness!"

452
00:35:21,117 --> 00:35:24,117
「じゃあ、ちょっと芋一番大きいの選びますね」って
and said, "Then let me pick the one with the biggest potato."

453
00:35:24,117 --> 00:35:25,617
奏チョイスで？
Kanade's choice?

454
00:35:25,617 --> 00:35:26,617
はい。
Yes.

455
00:35:26,617 --> 00:35:29,317
で、選んで。別にそれをこうあげようとしたわけじゃないんですけど、
And I chose it. I didn't particularly mean to give it to her, but...

456
00:35:29,317 --> 00:35:32,517
トコさんがそれをさ、譲ってくださって。
Toko-san let me have it.

457
00:35:32,517 --> 00:35:34,617
いや、それはそうでしょ。
Well, of course I would.

458
00:35:34,617 --> 00:35:35,517
えー？
Really?

459
00:35:35,517 --> 00:35:38,317
そんな、せっかくこれ「1番お芋大きいです」って選んでくれたら、
I mean, since you took the time to choose the one with the biggest potato...

460
00:35:38,317 --> 00:35:40,517
「あ、じゃあ、これで！」って。
I had to say, "Oh, then this one's for you!"

461
00:35:40,517 --> 00:35:44,317
「あ、じゃあこれで！」「譲ります！」って。
"Ah, then this one!" "I'll let you have it!"

462
00:35:44,317 --> 00:35:46,517
めちゃくちゃ嬉しかったです、あれ。
I was so happy about that.

463
00:35:46,517 --> 00:35:50,917
なんか、いろんな味あったんですけど、もう芋の大きさだけで選んでましたよね。
There were various flavors, but you chose solely based on the size of the potato.

464
00:35:51,117 --> 00:35:54,117
違うよ、奏が選んでくれたから、
No, because Kanade chose it for me,

465
00:35:54,117 --> 00:35:56,317
持ってったんよ、私は。
that's why I took it.

466
00:35:56,317 --> 00:35:57,517
感動しました。
I was so moved.

467
00:35:57,517 --> 00:35:59,117
あ、そうなんですか？
Oh, really?

468
00:35:59,117 --> 00:36:00,417
そうよ。
Yes, really.

469
00:36:00,417 --> 00:36:02,117
大好き。
I love you.

470
00:36:02,117 --> 00:36:03,617
ちょっと！
Wait, what!

471
00:36:03,617 --> 00:36:05,517
よかったらあの、今後とも何か機会があったら...
If you'd like, in the future, if there's an opportunity...

472
00:36:05,517 --> 00:36:06,717
もちろん！
Of course!

473
00:36:06,717 --> 00:36:08,617
なんか一緒にやりましょう。
Let's do something together again.

474
00:36:08,617 --> 00:36:09,617
3Dライブもやろう、一緒に。
Let's do a 3D live together, too.

475
00:36:09,617 --> 00:36:10,917
本当ですか？ユニットも組みます？
Really? Shall we form a unit, too?

476
00:36:10,917 --> 00:36:12,717
もう何でもやろう。全部やろう。やりたいこと全部やろう。
Let's do anything. Let's do it all. Let's do everything we want to do.

477
00:36:12,717 --> 00:36:13,717
本当ですか？よし。
Really? Alright!

478
00:36:13,717 --> 00:36:15,317
じゃあユニット名、
Then our unit name...

479
00:36:15,317 --> 00:36:16,517
「カルニス」で。
will be "Calnis".

480
00:36:16,517 --> 00:36:19,517
ちょっと被るか。ちょっと被るか、みたいな。
That overlaps a bit... just a bit.

481
00:36:19,517 --> 00:36:23,117
っていうのは冗談で、なんか一緒にできたら嬉しいです。
Jokes aside, I'd be really happy if we could do something together.

482
00:36:23,117 --> 00:36:24,517
一緒にやりましょう、ぜひまた。
Let's definitely do something together again.

483
00:36:24,517 --> 00:36:28,117
ありがとうございました、ということで、トコさんありがとうございました。
Thank you so much! Thank you, Toko-san.

484
00:36:28,117 --> 00:36:31,117
ありがとうございました。一緒に歌えて嬉しかった。
Thank you very much. I was so happy to sing together with you.

485
00:36:31,117 --> 00:36:32,317
またね。
See you!

486
00:36:32,317 --> 00:36:34,617
バイバイ！
Bye-bye!

487
00:36:35,117 --> 00:36:40,117
ふぅー。ということでですね、次がゲストは最後になります。
Phew. So, the next guest will be the last one.

488
00:36:40,117 --> 00:36:44,317
最後は、あの人！って、みんな分かるよね？
The last one is that person! You all know who, right?

489
00:36:44,317 --> 00:36:48,617
楽しみにしてててください。それでは、次の曲行きます。
Please look forward to it. Now, let's head to the next song.

490
00:37:21,117 --> 00:37:26,117
浪漫と算盤
[Title: Romance and Abacus]

491
00:37:35,117 --> 00:37:39,617
主義（プライド）を持って利益（サクセス）を成した
Possessing principles, achieving success,

492
00:37:39,617 --> 00:37:44,317
放した商売（バイバイ）嫌い
despising transaction let go.

493
00:37:44,317 --> 00:37:53,117
学問（アカデミー） 芸術（アート） 地上（ライフ）の意味を宿す
Imbued with the meaning of academia, art, and life.

494
00:37:54,617 --> 00:38:00,317
義務（ルール）解ければ理想（ロマンス）
If obligations dissolve, romance remains...

495
00:38:00,317 --> 00:38:04,317
重んじつつ飽くまで
valuing it to the very end.

496
00:38:04,317 --> 00:38:12,617
量子（ミクロ）割（ディバイド）は有耶無耶にしていたい<
I want to keep the micro-divide hazy.

497
00:38:12,617 --> 00:38:18,117
玄人（プロ） 素人（アマ） みんな労働者（ワーカー）
Pros, amateurs, we are all workers,

498
00:38:18,117 --> 00:38:24,117
賛否両論頂戴
so give us both praise and blame.

499
00:38:24,117 --> 00:38:28,117
お気に召さずとも野暮
Even if you dislike it, that's unrefined.

500
00:38:30,617 --> 00:38:39,117
新しい技 毎度繰り出して
Constantly unleashing new techniques,

501
00:38:39,117 --> 00:38:42,117
苦しくとも
even if it's painful,

502
00:38:42,117 --> 00:38:47,617
僕らは分かっている
we both understand.

503
00:38:47,617 --> 00:38:51,117
あなたも同じように
Just like you,

504
00:38:51,117 --> 00:38:56,117
独りで生きている
I am living alone.

505
00:38:56,117 --> 00:39:03,117
宇宙（スペース） お生い（ライフ）する向かい
Facing the living universe,

506
00:39:03,117 --> 00:39:06,117
仕留めたところで自由
we are free even if we conquer it.

507
00:39:06,117 --> 00:39:14,117
と言うと孤独だけが待っているんでしょう
Which means only loneliness awaits us, right?

508
00:39:15,117 --> 00:39:20,117
玄人（プロ）で素人（アマ）
Being a professional yet an amateur,

509
00:39:20,117 --> 00:39:24,117
労働者（ワーカー）で生活者（コンシューマー）のまんま
remaining a worker and a consumer.

510
00:39:25,117 --> 00:39:30,117
面白おかしくさせて
Make things fun and amusing.

511
00:39:31,117 --> 00:39:41,617
喧（かまびす）しい契約（ディール） 毎度請け負って
Constantly taking on boisterous deals,

512
00:39:41,617 --> 00:39:45,117
虚しくとも
even if it's in vain,

513
00:39:45,117 --> 00:39:49,117
あなたを想う度
every time I think of you,

514
00:39:49,117 --> 00:39:53,117
僕は許されていく
I am being forgiven.

515
00:39:53,117 --> 00:39:59,117
夢と現（うつつ）を往来（また）いで
Crossing between dreams and reality.

516
00:40:00,192 --> 00:40:04,992
きっとそう浪漫抱えたら
Surely, if we embrace romance,

517
00:40:05,192 --> 00:40:08,592
算盤弾いて
let's use the abacus.

518
00:40:10,592 --> 00:40:14,092
両極のど真ん中
Right in the middle of both extremes,

519
00:40:14,292 --> 00:40:20,592
狙い撃てお願い勇気をくれ
aim and shoot—please give me courage.

520
00:40:21,092 --> 00:40:25,592
疑わしい相手なら
If it's a suspicious opponent,

521
00:40:26,592 --> 00:40:30,092
いつだって
any time,

522
00:40:30,592 --> 00:40:36,092
自分ずっと進化したいよね
I want to keep evolving.

523
00:40:36,192 --> 00:40:39,592
答え合わせ
Checking our answers,

524
00:40:39,592 --> 00:40:43,092
あなたを知るほど
the more I know you,

525
00:40:43,392 --> 00:40:47,392
僕は正されていく
the more I am corrected.

526
00:40:47,392 --> 00:40:52,592
捨てたもんじゃない
We're not completely hopeless...

527
00:40:52,892 --> 00:41:01,092
ただ生きようと
I'll just try to live.

528
00:41:46,892 --> 00:41:48,892
うわああ！
Whoa!

529
00:41:48,892 --> 00:41:51,592
マイクが遠いぜ。
The microphone was too far!

530
00:41:51,592 --> 00:41:53,592
体震えた！
My body was shaking!

531
00:41:53,592 --> 00:41:57,092
何てタフな持ち方。
What a tough way to hold it!

532
00:41:56,592 --> 00:41:59,092
ロックでしょ？ イェーイ！
Isn't that rock? / Yeah!

533
00:41:59,092 --> 00:42:01,592
いやー、いいですね。スタンドマイクかっこいいじゃないですか。
Man, that's great. Stand mics are so cool, aren't they?

534
00:42:01,592 --> 00:42:03,592
かっこいいですよね。
They really are.

535
00:42:03,592 --> 00:42:05,592
ね、おめでとうございます、本当に！
Seriously, congratulations!

536
00:42:05,592 --> 00:42:07,592
ありがとう。ありがとうございます。
Thank you! Thank you so much!

537
00:42:07,592 --> 00:42:09,592
これちょっとウケるね。もう一回いこう。せーの。
This is kind of funny. Let's do it again. Ready, go!

538
00:42:09,592 --> 00:42:11,592
ありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

539
00:42:11,592 --> 00:42:15,292
はい、ということで、最後のゲストはすいちゃん先輩でした！
Alright! So, our final guest was Suichan-senpai!

540
00:42:15,292 --> 00:42:18,092
はい、ありがとうございます、呼んでくださって。
Yes, thank you so much for having me!

541
00:42:18,092 --> 00:42:22,592
彗星のごとく現れたスターの原石、バーチャルアイドルの星街すいせいです！皆さんこんにちは！
"A shooting star, a diamond in the rough! Virtual idol Hoshimachi Suisei!" Hello, everyone!

542
00:42:22,592 --> 00:42:24,592
こんにちは！
Hello!

543
00:42:24,592 --> 00:42:27,592
音の税の皆さんなんですよね。 あ、はい、そうです。正式名称。
You guys are the "Otono-zei," right? / Ah, yes, that's right. That's the official name.

544
00:42:27,592 --> 00:42:29,592
素晴らしい！
Splendid!

545
00:42:29,592 --> 00:42:34,092
音の税の皆さん、いつも「お前ら」と言われていますけれども。
Though the Otono-zei are usually referred to as "you guys."

546
00:42:34,092 --> 00:42:37,592
はい、いや、もう、今回の「浪漫と算盤」という楽曲、
Yes! Man, this song, "Roman to Soroban,"

547
00:42:37,592 --> 00:42:41,592
すいちゃん先輩と一緒に歌ったら絶対にカッコいいだろうなって思って。
I just knew it would be incredibly cool to sing it with Suichan-senpai!

548
00:42:41,592 --> 00:42:46,592
まあ、カッコいいけどさ、生でやるもんじゃないよね！
Well, it is cool, but it's really not something you should perform live!

549
00:42:46,592 --> 00:42:50,092
もう私本当に、もう私、昨日とかさ、
I was seriously... even yesterday...

550
00:42:50,092 --> 00:42:54,092
「歌えるかしら、歌えるかしら」って、もう、すごい不安だったけど、
I was so anxious, thinking, "Can I sing it? Can I really sing it?"

551
00:42:54,092 --> 00:42:56,592
今日合わせてみて、よかったじゃん。
But after performing it today, it turned out great, didn't it?

552
00:42:56,592 --> 00:42:58,092
よかったです。
It did!

553
00:42:58,092 --> 00:43:00,592
よかったじゃん。 めちゃくちゃ美声でしたよ。
It went so well. / You had such a beautiful voice!

554
00:43:00,592 --> 00:43:03,592
めちゃめちゃ美声でしたよ返し。
Right back at you with a beautiful voice!

555
00:43:03,592 --> 00:43:06,092
ありがとうございます。
Thank you so much!

556
00:43:06,092 --> 00:43:10,092
コメント欄もね、めっちゃよかった、めっちゃよかったって。
Even the comments section is saying, "It was amazing, so good!"

557
00:43:10,092 --> 00:43:15,092
めちゃめちゃ、相性良かった。ほら、相性良かったって。 嬉しい！
"They had amazing chemistry." Look, they're saying our chemistry was great! / I'm so glad!

558
00:43:15,092 --> 00:43:18,092
よかったらまた歌ってくださいね、一緒に。
Please sing with me again sometime!

559
00:43:18,092 --> 00:43:22,092
あ、そうそう。なんか二人だけで歌うの初めてなんだよね。
Ah, right, right! It was actually our first time singing as just a duo, wasn't it?

560
00:43:22,092 --> 00:43:28,092
そうなんです。「パンダヒーロー」で4人で一緒に歌うってことはあったんですけど、今回二人きりは初めてということで。
Yes! We sang "Panda Hero" together as a group of four, but this was our first time as a duo.

561
00:43:28,092 --> 00:43:31,092
ね、すごい楽しかったですし。 でも、またね、呼んでくださいよ、奏ちゃん。
Yes, it was so much fun! / Please invite me again, Kanade-chan.

562
00:43:31,092 --> 00:43:34,092
奏ちゃんのためなら飛んできますよ。 ぜひ！ぜひ！
I'll fly right over for you. / Please do!

563
00:43:34,092 --> 00:43:41,092
生でハモリという、すごい難しい難題を一緒に飛び越えられて、嬉しいです。
I'm so happy we tackled the huge challenge of live harmony together.

564
00:43:41,092 --> 00:43:44,092
飛び越えたね！ 嬉しかったです！
We totally nailed it! / I'm so happy!

565
00:43:44,092 --> 00:43:50,092
頑張りました、私たち。ぜひともね、アーカイブ残るしね、何回も聴き返してほしいですね。 はい、ぜひ！
We did our best! It'll be archived, so I hope everyone listens to it over and over. / Yes, please do!

566
00:43:50,092 --> 00:43:55,092
はい、ということで、奏さん、この後もまだまだ続くと思いますが、頑張ってください！
Alright! Kanade-san, there's still more to come after this, so good luck!

567
00:43:55,092 --> 00:43:58,092
ありがとうございます！本当にありがとうございました！
Thank you so much! Truly, thank you very much!

568
00:43:58,092 --> 00:44:01,092
ありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

569
00:44:01,092 --> 00:44:03,592
それでは失礼します。
Well then, I'll be off!

570
00:44:03,592 --> 00:44:07,592
はい！ありがとうございましたー！
Yes! Thank you so much!

571
00:44:07,592 --> 00:44:13,592
さあ、ゲストの皆さんにね、たくさん盛り上げていただきました、ということで、ここからはソロでですね、
Well, the guests have really hyped things up for us, so from here on, I'll be going solo.

572
00:44:13,592 --> 00:44:18,092
えー、頑張っていきますよ、ということで。
Yes, I'm going to give it my all!

573
00:44:18,092 --> 00:44:22,092
まだまだ、まだまだ盛り上げていきます！
We're going to keep keeping this excitement going!

574
00:44:22,092 --> 00:44:27,592
その前にちょっと、準備とお水飲んでくるので、待っててください。行ってきます！
But before that, I need to get ready and grab some water, so please wait a bit. Be right back!

575
00:44:55,592 --> 00:45:00,092
ここからは一気に5曲、いっちゃいます！
From here on, I'm going to perform five songs in a row!

576
00:45:00,640 --> 00:45:02,340
最後には...
At the very end...

577
00:45:02,740 --> 00:45:06,340
し、し、し、シークレットだもん！
I-I-It's a secret!

578
00:45:06,640 --> 00:45:09,940
最後のお楽しみに、ということで
As a final treat.

579
00:45:10,040 --> 00:45:13,340
それでは次の曲 聴いてください
Well then, please listen to the next song.

580
00:45:13,840 --> 00:45:15,940
All Alone With You

581
00:45:32,940 --> 00:45:40,140
Yeah yeah yeah...

582
00:45:40,940 --> 00:45:44,340
誰かを愛することなんて
Loving someone...

583
00:45:44,340 --> 00:45:48,440
できるわけなくって だけど誰かに
...is impossible, but still, I wanted to...

584
00:45:48,440 --> 00:45:53,140
愛されたくて
...be loved by someone.

585
00:45:54,140 --> 00:45:57,940
変わらない昨日がずっと
Even if an unchanging yesterday...

586
00:45:57,940 --> 00:46:01,140
続いたとしても
...were to continue forever...

587
00:46:01,140 --> 00:46:04,340
どこにも行きやしないんだ
...we won't go anywhere.

588
00:46:04,340 --> 00:46:08,140
私とキミ
You and I.

589
00:46:08,140 --> 00:46:11,340
神様
God...

590
00:46:11,340 --> 00:46:16,640
どこへ行ってしまったの ねえ
...where have you gone? Hey,

591
00:46:17,140 --> 00:46:20,640
返事はなくて
there is no answer,

592
00:46:20,640 --> 00:46:24,140
いつだって
as always.

593
00:46:24,140 --> 00:46:30,140
そうだよ
That's how it is.

594
00:46:31,140 --> 00:46:33,340
Are you still here?

595
00:46:33,640 --> 00:46:35,140
You’ll never walk alone
You'll never walk alone

596
00:46:35,140 --> 00:46:38,140
あなたと行く
I will go with you.

597
00:46:38,140 --> 00:46:41,640
どんな罪も
Whatever sins we commit,

598
00:46:41,640 --> 00:46:44,940
背負ってあげる
I will shoulder them for you.

599
00:46:48,140 --> 00:46:51,340
道なき道を
Along this pathless road,

600
00:46:51,340 --> 00:46:54,940
歩いてくの
I will walk...

601
00:46:54,940 --> 00:46:58,340
あなたと
...with you.

602
00:47:00,140 --> 00:47:03,140
二人で
Just the two of us.

603
00:47:14,340 --> 00:47:17,940
こっちにきて購入
Come over here,

604
00:47:17,940 --> 00:47:21,140
私に触れて キスをして
touch me and kiss me.

605
00:47:21,140 --> 00:47:23,140
もっと
More...

606
00:47:23,140 --> 00:47:25,140
めちゃくちゃにしたって
...it's okay if you mess me up...

607
00:47:25,140 --> 00:47:28,140
いいんだよ
...completely.

608
00:47:28,140 --> 00:47:31,140
いつか誰もが死んじゃって
If everyone dies someday...

609
00:47:31,140 --> 00:47:34,640
忘れられてくなら
...and is forgotten,

610
00:47:34,640 --> 00:47:37,640
今確かなものだけを
...then right now, only the certain things...

611
00:47:37,640 --> 00:47:40,140
信じるわ
...I will believe in.

612
00:47:41,140 --> 00:47:45,140
神様気取りの人が言うの
Pretentious people who act like gods say,

613
00:47:45,140 --> 00:47:49,140
ねえ
"Hey,"

614
00:47:49,640 --> 00:47:53,140
人は強いって
"people are strong."

615
00:47:53,140 --> 00:47:57,140
そんなの
That's...

616
00:47:57,640 --> 00:48:01,140
嘘だよ
...a lie.

617
00:48:04,340 --> 00:48:06,140
Do you agree?

618
00:48:07,140 --> 00:48:09,140
I will stay with you

619
00:48:09,340 --> 00:48:12,140
あなたの手で
With your hands,

620
00:48:12,140 --> 00:48:15,640
抱きしめてよ
hold me tight.

621
00:48:15,640 --> 00:48:20,140
思いっきり
With all your might.

622
00:48:20,340 --> 00:48:24,140
怖がらないで
Don't be afraid.

623
00:48:24,340 --> 00:48:28,140
もう大丈夫
It's alright now.

624
00:48:28,140 --> 00:48:32,140
私なら
If it's me...

625
00:48:34,140 --> 00:48:37,140
その手が
Even if those hands...

626
00:48:37,140 --> 00:48:41,140
汚れてしまったとしても
...have become dirty,

627
00:48:41,340 --> 00:48:48,140
愛してほしい
I want you to love...

628
00:48:51,140 --> 00:48:55,140
私のこと
...me.

629
00:49:27,340 --> 00:49:29,640
You’ll never walk alone
You'll never walk alone

630
00:49:29,640 --> 00:49:32,940
あなたと行く
I will go with you.

631
00:49:32,940 --> 00:49:36,140
どんな罪も
Whatever sins we commit,

632
00:49:36,140 --> 00:49:40,140
背負ってあげる
I will shoulder them for you.

633
00:49:40,140 --> 00:49:43,140
道なき道を
Along this pathless road,

634
00:49:43,140 --> 00:49:47,140
歩いてくの
I will walk...

635
00:49:47,140 --> 00:49:50,140
あなたと
...with you.

636
00:49:53,940 --> 00:49:56,640
I will stay with you
And I'll stay with you

637
00:49:56,640 --> 00:49:59,640
あなたの手で
With your hands,

638
00:50:00,115 --> 00:50:01,915
…きしめてよ
...embrace me.

639
00:50:01,915 --> 00:50:04,615
思いきり
With all your heart.

640
00:50:04,915 --> 00:50:07,915
望めない
For there is nothing...

641
00:50:07,915 --> 00:50:11,315
ものはないから
...we cannot hope for,

642
00:50:11,315 --> 00:50:17,615
あなたと
...together...

643
00:50:17,615 --> 00:50:25,615
二人で
...with you.

644
00:50:33,315 --> 00:50:38,115
Yeah...

645
00:51:29,615 --> 00:51:38,615
give it back
作詞・作曲: 中村未来
[Title: give it back
Lyrics & Composition: Miku Nakamura]

646
00:51:39,915 --> 00:51:44,315
暖かい涙で
Suddenly I woke up...

647
00:51:44,315 --> 00:51:49,115
ふいに目覚めた
...to my warm tears.

648
00:51:49,115 --> 00:51:54,115
焦がれた
Where can I recapture...

649
00:51:54,115 --> 00:51:58,315
夢の続きは
...the thread...

650
00:51:58,315 --> 00:52:03,115
何処にあるの
...of that dream?

651
00:52:03,115 --> 00:52:05,615
寂しいよ
I feel so alone...

652
00:52:05,615 --> 00:52:08,615
please, give it back

653
00:52:12,315 --> 00:52:17,315
いつになれば
When will I...

654
00:52:17,315 --> 00:52:20,915
楽になれる
...finally be free?

655
00:52:20,915 --> 00:52:24,115
押ししては返す
Fighting off the waves...

656
00:52:24,115 --> 00:52:28,115
波に抗って
...coming and going.

657
00:52:32,615 --> 00:52:37,115
白い枕に
Still groggy with sleep...

658
00:52:37,115 --> 00:52:41,915
寝惚けたままの顔を
...I bury my face...

659
00:52:41,915 --> 00:52:46,115
うずめて
...in a white pillow.

660
00:52:46,115 --> 00:52:51,115
同じ夢を
As I wish to have...

661
00:52:51,115 --> 00:52:58,115
願うほどに冴えていくよ
...the same dream again, I wake up further.

662
00:52:58,115 --> 00:53:01,115
please, give it back

663
00:53:05,115 --> 00:53:10,615
変わりなんていないよ
There is nobody but you.

664
00:53:10,615 --> 00:53:15,615
あなたの匂い
Your scent...

665
00:53:15,615 --> 00:53:20,615
思い出せない波に
...I cannot remember, as it is carried away...

666
00:53:20,615 --> 00:53:26,115
攫われて
...by the waves.

667
00:53:29,915 --> 00:53:34,615
夢の続きを
Recapturing the thread of that dream...

668
00:53:34,615 --> 00:53:39,615
捕まえにいくから待ってて
...I'll go find it, so please wait for me.

669
00:53:39,615 --> 00:53:44,315
いつの間にか孤独ぶるには
Before I knew it, I had felt too much kindness...

670
00:53:44,315 --> 00:53:48,615
優しさに触れすぎた
...to pretend to be alone anymore.

671
00:53:48,615 --> 00:53:53,115
沁みていく顔上げてみようか
It's soaking in, so let's raise our heads.

672
00:53:53,115 --> 00:53:58,115
ひとりじゃないって信じてみたい
I want to believe that I'm not alone.

673
00:53:58,115 --> 00:54:02,615
信じてみたいの
I really want to believe.

674
00:54:02,615 --> 00:54:05,115
give it a shot

675
00:54:05,115 --> 00:54:10,315
生まれたばかりの
In this newborn...

676
00:54:10,315 --> 00:54:13,115
淡い光に
...faint light...

677
00:54:13,115 --> 00:54:18,115
希望を見たの 胸が熱いよ
...I saw hope, and my heart feels hot.

678
00:54:18,115 --> 00:54:24,115
手を握っていよう
Let us hold hands...

679
00:54:24,115 --> 00:54:29,115
迷わないように
...so we won't get lost.

680
00:54:29,115 --> 00:54:34,115
明日からまた
Starting tomorrow...

681
00:54:34,115 --> 00:54:41,615
選んだ道を進めるように
...so we can continue to walk the chosen path.

682
00:55:28,363 --> 00:55:31,063
敗北の少年
Defeated Boy

683
00:55:31,063 --> 00:55:33,963
お前ら！まだまだいくぞー！
Everyone! We're still keeping this going!

684
00:55:36,563 --> 00:55:38,563
ぶつかって
Struggling,

685
00:55:38,563 --> 00:55:41,463
逃げ込んで
running away,

686
00:55:41,463 --> 00:55:46,563
僕はいつしかここに立ってた
before I knew it, I was standing here.

687
00:55:46,563 --> 00:55:48,963
誰もが
Everyone

688
00:55:48,963 --> 00:55:51,763
憧れるヒーローに
wants to be the hero they admire,

689
00:55:51,763 --> 00:55:53,763
なりたくて
wishing to become one,

690
00:55:53,763 --> 00:55:56,663
でもなれなくて
but unable to.

691
00:55:56,663 --> 00:56:00,363
これくらいじゃ
At this rate,

692
00:56:00,363 --> 00:56:02,663
届かないこと
I won't reach you,

693
00:56:02,663 --> 00:56:05,863
分かっていたのに
even though I already knew that.

694
00:56:05,863 --> 00:56:08,763
敗北の少年
Defeated boy,

695
00:56:08,763 --> 00:56:11,963
現実を謳え
sing praises of reality.

696
00:56:11,963 --> 00:56:15,663
あんな風に空は飛べやしないんだ
We can't fly through the sky like that.

697
00:56:15,663 --> 00:56:19,563
こんな夜に意味があるなら
If there's meaning to a night like this,

698
00:56:19,563 --> 00:56:25,663
僕らは地を這う
we will crawl across the ground.

699
00:56:35,663 --> 00:56:38,363
耳鳴りが
A ringing in my ears

700
00:56:38,363 --> 00:56:41,063
こだまして
echoes,

701
00:56:41,063 --> 00:56:46,463
僕に奇跡が問いかけるんだ
and a miracle asks me...

702
00:56:46,463 --> 00:56:49,063
「君の夢
"Your dream of becoming

703
00:56:49,063 --> 00:56:51,763
憧れたヒーローに
the hero you admired...

704
00:56:51,763 --> 00:56:56,163
今すぐさせてあげよう」
I'll make it come true right now."

705
00:56:56,163 --> 00:57:00,263
飴みたいに差し伸べられたって
Even if it's offered to me like candy,

706
00:57:00,263 --> 00:57:05,663
嬉しくないんだ
I'm not happy at all.

707
00:57:05,663 --> 00:57:08,463
敗北の少年
Defeated boy,

708
00:57:08,463 --> 00:57:11,063
存在を謳え
sing praises of existence.

709
00:57:11,063 --> 00:57:15,663
君みたいに眩しくはなれないけど
Though I can't be radiant like you,

710
00:57:15,663 --> 00:57:19,363
こんな夜に意味があるなら
if there's meaning to a night like this,

711
00:57:19,363 --> 00:57:24,563
僕らは地を這う
we will crawl across the ground.

712
00:57:24,563 --> 00:57:27,963
まだ地を這う
And yet crawl the ground...

713
00:57:48,663 --> 00:57:51,363
鼓動を知って
Feeling my heartbeat,

714
00:57:51,363 --> 00:57:54,063
息を吸い込んで
taking a deep breath,

715
00:57:54,063 --> 00:57:57,863
「僕は遠慮するよ」
"No thanks, I'll pass."

716
00:57:57,863 --> 00:58:00,163
敗北の...
Defeated...

717
00:58:00,163 --> 00:58:02,663
敗北の少年
Defeated boy,

718
00:58:02,663 --> 00:58:05,463
平凡を謳え
sing praises of normalcy.

719
00:58:05,463 --> 00:58:09,263
あいにくと神は信じないタチで
Unfortunately, I'm not the type to believe in God.

720
00:58:09,263 --> 00:58:14,163
すれ違いの物語よ
To this passing story...

721
00:58:14,163 --> 00:58:18,663
さようなら
...farewell.

722
00:58:18,663 --> 00:58:21,163
敗北の少年
Defeated boy,

723
00:58:21,163 --> 00:58:24,163
現実を謳え
sing praises of reality.

724
00:58:24,163 --> 00:58:27,963
僕らは泥を傷つくばるもの
We are the ones who crawl through the mud.

725
00:58:27,963 --> 00:58:32,563
こんな夜も愛しいから
Because even a night like this is beloved,

726
00:58:32,563 --> 00:58:35,963
僕らは地を這う
we will crawl across the ground.

727
00:58:35,963 --> 00:58:39,663
ただ地を這う
Just crawl across the ground.

728
00:59:16,163 --> 00:59:17,163
あのね
You know...

729
00:59:17,663 --> 00:59:23,663
Luna say maybe

730
00:59:44,363 --> 00:59:45,463
あのね
You know...

731
00:59:45,463 --> 00:59:46,763
I say 「私、大丈夫？」
I say, "Am I okay?"

732
00:59:46,763 --> 00:59:48,263
Maybe, うまくやれるはず
Maybe, I should be able to do well.

733
00:59:48,263 --> 00:59:51,463
ずっと走った 息継ぎもしないまま
Running the whole time without even catching my breath.

734
00:59:51,463 --> 00:59:53,163
あっそう、終わりが来るなら
Oh right, if the end is coming,

735
00:59:53,163 --> 00:59:55,463
別に寂しくなんかはない
I'm not particularly lonely.

736
00:59:55,463 --> 00:59:57,763
真実は心の奥の方
The truth is deep inside my heart.

737
00:59:57,763 --> 01:00:01,163
自分のことすら愛せないまま
Without even being able to love myself...

738
01:00:00,138 --> 01:00:04,738
れないまま 君のこと守れるのかな
...unable to even love myself, can I protect you?

739
01:00:04,738 --> 01:00:06,738
信じて
Believe me.

740
01:00:06,738 --> 01:00:10,138
どうか、正真正銘のこの思いを聴いて
Please, listen to my true, genuine feelings.

741
01:00:10,138 --> 01:00:13,738
私、全身全霊で歌うから
Because I'm singing with all my heart and soul.

742
01:00:13,788 --> 01:00:17,438
大丈夫、世界はこんなに綺麗だと
It's okay, I understand that the world is so beautiful...

743
01:00:17,438 --> 01:00:20,838
分かってる、分かってる、分かってる、わかってるよ！
I know, I know, I know, I know!

744
01:00:20,838 --> 01:00:22,638
ごめんね。じれったい
I'm sorry. It's frustrating.

745
01:00:22,638 --> 01:00:24,538
足りない、こんなんじゃ誰も愛せないの
It's not enough, I can't love anyone like this.

746
01:00:24,538 --> 01:00:27,838
止めない、止まることは知らないの
Don't stop, I don't know how to stop.

747
01:00:27,838 --> 01:00:30,638
言葉足らず、失くしてしまう物ばかりだ
With my lack of words, I only end up losing things.

748
01:00:33,138 --> 01:00:38,338
Luna say maybe... 降るのは、
Luna say maybe... What falls is,

749
01:00:38,338 --> 01:00:41,938
迷be, rainy
maybe, rainy.

750
01:00:48,638 --> 01:00:51,938
愛せ、どんな自分でも
Love whoever you are,

751
01:00:51,938 --> 01:00:55,338
Navy色に染まるまで
